WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
A repeated shape creates a pulse for the eye.

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:08.388
Keep the spacing regular, then change one element to make an accent.

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:14.401
A second color can introduce a new layer without increasing the number of shapes.

00:00:14.401 --> 00:00:19.375
Finally, leave a quiet area so the composition has room to breathe.

00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:27.170
This motion study is about visual rhythm; it does not contain a commercial song or an artist performance.

